14:25:39  == Installing Chat Computer next to macOS
14:25:39  The Asahi installer makes room next to macOS and installs Chat Computer's base (Fedora Linux) there. Setup
14:25:39  answers its questions. When it asks for your Mac's password, type it (it stays hidden) and press Enter.
14:25:39  It takes about 10 to 20 minutes; your Mac may seem to freeze while macOS's partition shrinks. That's normal.
14:25:39  First, your Mac's password for setup itself:
14:25:41  STOPPED The Asahi installer didn't finish (see above; its log is /tmp/chatcomputer-ci.NpVsOU/work/asahi-installer.log). If it made room or partitions, run setup again and choose "Remove Chat Computer from this Mac" to clean up.
